@startuml MRTR 交互中途崩溃:无状态的从容
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowparam false
skinparam shadow false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title MRTR 中途崩溃:Instance A 返回后崩溃,第二轮自动落到 B

participant "Claude Code" as CC
participant "Instance A" as A
participant "Instance B" as B

== 第一轮:工具调用发起 ==
CC -> A  : tools/call "deploy" {params}
A --> CC : resultType: input_required\n{ "部署到 prod 还是 staging?" }

note right of A #DDF3E4
  返回后,连接已关闭
  A 不持有任何中间状态
end note

== A 崩溃(但此时已无所谓)==
A -> CC : 💥 Instance A 崩溃被摘除
note right of CC : 用户正在思考输入...\nA 的死活已无关紧要

== 第二轮:带答案重试,自动路由到 B ==
CC -> B  : tools/call "deploy" {params,\n   inputResponses: { env: "prod" }}
note right of B #DDF3E4
  B 从未见过此客户端
  但从请求里的 inputResponses
  照样能继续执行
end note
B --> CC : result(部署成功)

note over CC, B
  <b>关键:答案在客户端持有的请求里,不在服务器内存里</b>
  所以 A 的崩溃不会丢失任何交互上下文
end note

@enduml
